  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiscal Management Modernization Program of the State of Amazonas - PROFISCO III AM</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Modernizacin de la Gestin Fiscal del Estado de Amazonas - PROFISCO III AM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo es contribuir a la sostenibilidad fiscal del Estado de Amazonas, a travs de los objetivos especficos de desarrollo de: (i) mejorar la efectividad de la gestin del ingreso y (ii) mejorar la efectividad de la gestin del gasto pblico.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective is to contribute to the fiscal sustainability of the State of Amazonas, through the specific development objectives of: (i) improving the effectiveness of income management; and (ii) improving the effectiveness of public spending management.</narrative>
  </description>
